)}^{2}+({y}_{2}-{y}_{1}{)}^{2}+({z}_{2}-{z}_{1}{)}^{2}}.\n$$\n\nIn this case, we have $A{{(-1,4,-1)}_{⏟}}_{\\text{(}{x}_{1}\\text{, }{y}_{1}\\text{, }{z}_{1}\\text{)}}$ and $B{{(2,6,5)}_{⏟}}_{\\text{(}{x}_{2}\\text{, }{y}_{2}\\text{, }{z}_{2}\\text{)}}.$ Therefore,\n\n$$\n\\begin{aligned}d & =\\sqrt{(2-(-1){)}^{2}+(6-4{)}^{2}+(5-(-1){)}^{2}} \\\\  & =\\sqrt{{3}^{2}+{2}^{2}+{6}^{2}} \\\\  & =\\sqrt{9+4+36} \\\\  & =\\sqrt{49} \\\\  & =7.\\end{aligned}\n$$" 13194139533628 true] [17592186242672 1000 #edb/ref 17592186242673 13194139533628 true] [17592186242672 1040 #edb/ref 17592186045449 13194139533628 true] [17592186242672 1041 "field-1" 13194139533628 true] [17592186242672 1104 #edb/ref 17592186242673 13194139533628 true] [17592186242672 1110 #uuid "0fee43ed-eb26-59a0-9017-0f3209718402" 13194139533628 true] [17592186242673 1034 "7" 13194139533628 true] [17592186242673 1103 #edb/ref 17592186045453 13194139533628 true] [17592186242673 1111 #uuid "c408819d-2bce-59a4-ac90-4ef4f62eb63d" 13194139533628 true] [17592186242674 1017 #edb/ref 17592186242675 13194139533628 true] [17592186242674 1089 "q-262216" 13194139533628 true] [17592186242674 1091 #edb/ref 17592186045463 13194139533628 true] [17592186242674 1100 "The distance between the points $A(5,-2,-3)$ and $B(2,2,-3)$ is{{field-1}}." 13194139533628 true] [17592186242674 1113 #uuid "7ece7e52-279f-5dba-9e0d-33706c4c02a1" 13194139533628 true] [17592186242674 1138 false 13194139533628 true] [17592186242674 1145 "The distance $d$ between two points $A({x}_{1},{y}_{1},{z}_{1})$ and $B({x}_{2},{y}_{2},{z}_{2})$ is given by\n\n$$\nd=\\sqrt{({x}_{2}-{x}_{1}{)}^{2}+({y}_{2}-{y}_{1}{)}^{2}+({z}_{2}-{z}_{1}{)}^{2}}.\n$$\n\nIn this case, we have $A{{(5,-2,-3)}_{⏟}}_{\\text{(}{x}_{1}\\text{, }{y}_{1}\\text{, }{z}_{1}\\text{)}}$ and $B{{(2,2,-3)}_{⏟}}_{\\text{(}{x}_{2}\\text{, }{y}_{2}\\text{, }{z}_{2}\\text{)}}.$ Therefore,\n\n$$\n\\begin{aligned}d & =\\sqrt{(2-5{)}^{2}+(2-(-2){)}^{2}+(-3-(-3){)}^{2}} \\\\  & =\\sqrt{(-3{)}^{2}+{4}^{2}+{0}^{2}} \\\\  & =\\sqrt{9+16+0} \\\\  & =\\sqrt{25} \\\\  & =5.\\end{aligned}\n$$" 13194139533628 true] [17592186242675 1000 #edb/ref 17592186242676 13194139533628 true] [17592186242675 1000 #edb/ref 17592186242677 13194139533628 true] [17592186242675 1040 #edb/ref 17592186045449 13194139533628 true] [17592186242675 1041 "field-1" 13194139533628 true] [17592186242675 1104 #edb/ref 17592186242677 13194139533628 true] [17592186242675 1110 #uuid "224286ef-6e0d-55fa-ac96-40bf3d2cddb1" 13194139533628 true] [17592186242676 1034 "6" 13194139533628 true] [17592186242676 1103 #edb/ref 17592186045453 13194139533628 true] [17592186242676 1111 #uuid "0c74c9b7-9277-5d89-99df-2106b8fecea3" 13194139533628 true] [17592186242677 1034 "5" 13194139533628 true] [17592186242677 1103 #edb/ref 17592186045453 13194139533628 true] [17592186242677 1111 #uuid "54a8a3e2-acdc-5dfe-887e-26eec66da0d9" 13194139533628 true] [17592186242678 1017 #edb/ref 17592186242679 13194139533628 true] [17592186242678 1089 "q-262223" 13194139533628 true] [17592186242678 1091 #edb/ref 17592186045463 13194139533628 true] [17592186242678 1100 "The distance between the points $A(4,-2,-2)$ and $B(3,-4,2)$ is{{field-1}}." 13194139533628 true] [17592186242678 1113 #uuid "f252ca68-1ec7-54e9-bf4a-2b98cecc1ea3" 13194139533628 true] [17592186242678 1138 false 13194139533628 true] [17592186242678 1145 "The distance $d$ between two points $A({x}_{1},{y}_{1},{z}_{1})$ and $B({x}_{2},{y}_{2},{z}_{2})$ is given by\n\n$$\nd=\\sqrt{({x}_{2}-{x}_{1}{)}^{2}+({y}_{2}-{y}_{1}{)}^{2}+({z}_{2}-{z}_{1}{)}^{2}}.\n$$\n\nIn this case, we have $A{{(4,-2,-2)}_{⏟}}_{\\text{(}{x}_{1}\\text{, }{y}_{1}\\text{, }{z}_{1}\\text{)}}$ and $B{{(3,-4,2)}_{⏟}}_{\\text{(}{x}_{2}\\text{, }{y}_{2}\\text{, }{z}_{2}\\text{)}}.$ Therefore,\n\n$$\n\\begin{aligned}d & =\\sqrt{(3-4{)}^{2}+(-4-(-2){)}^{2}+(2-(-2){)}^{2}} \\\\  & =\\sqrt{(-1{)}^{2}+(-2{)}^{2}+{4}^{2}} \\\\  & =\\sqrt{1+4+16} \\\\  & =\\sqrt{21}.\\end{aligned}\n$$" 13194139533628 true] [1759218